    `description`:"Queues a run of the scheduler job `keys.data-key-rotate-now` and answers **202** with its `runId`. Every stored data encryption key — or one realm's, or one class's — gets a successor, used `keys.dataKeyActivationLeadSeconds` after it is published; what the old key sealed is re-sealed by `keys.data-key-reencrypt`. 400 (STS-KEYS-0100) where data keys are derived per run and not stored, or where none serves the realm or class.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/encryption/data-keys` on the admin console.",
