    `description`:"A LIST and never key material. The signing keys are per trust realm and the TLS certificate belongs to the process, and each row says which. `formats` is what that key can be exported as, computed rather than listed: a key with no certificate cannot be a PKCS#12, and a post-quantum key has no PKCS#8 encoding at all, so the answer differs per key for two different reasons.\n\nNothing here is key material. POST /admin-api/keys/export is the operation that hands one over.\n\n**Mirrors** `GET /admin/keys` on the admin console.",
