    `operationId`:"revokeUserSigningCertificate",
    `summary`:"Revoke one of somebody's message-signing certificates",
    `description`:"Revokes a certificate `issue-signing-certificate` issued to THIS person — a serial belonging to anybody else, or one of their TLS client certificates, matches nothing (`STS-PKI-0221`) — onto the Issuing CA's CRL and OCSP responder. A WS-Trust request signed with it is refused from then on. The person's certificates are listed in `mfa.signing` of GET /admin-api/users?user= (#521).\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/users, POST /admin/users/new, POST /admin/users/edit and POST /admin/users/service-account` on the admin console.",
