    `operationId`:"finishUserPasskeyEnrolment",
    `summary`:"Finish enrolling a passkey for somebody",
    `description`:"Verifies what your browser's `navigator.credentials.create()` produced EXACTLY as the person's own registration is verified — the challenge, the origin and RP ID, user verification, the algorithms offered, the exclusion, the attestation statement (#105) and its algorithms (#941), and the passkey policy's registration rules (#718 and the rest) — and writes the key through the same writer, marked `enrolledBy` (you, your token's `sub`, and when). The enrolment is SPENT by this call whatever it answers: a second finish is refused (STS-AUTHN-0442, STS-AUTHN-0443).\n\n**Shared Signals**: a CAEP `credential-change` (`fido2-*`, `create`, initiated by `admin`), and the person is sent the security notice `passkey-enrolled`. Audited as `admin.passkey.enrolled`.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/users, POST /admin/users/new, POST /admin/users/edit and POST /admin/users/service-account` on the admin console.",
