    `description`:"Clears the instant a logout stamped on the principal, so a ticket-granting ticket authenticated before it is accepted again.\n\n**DEVELOPMENT MODE ONLY**: product mode refuses it (HTTP 400). **A real KDC has no such operation.** A fresh AS-REQ gets a ticket newer than the instant but does NOT clear it — tickets from before it stay refused, renewals included, until the latest one of them could still be valid. This exists so a test can put a signed-out ticket back into service without restarting the service.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/logout` on the admin console.",
