@js(#{
    `description`:"Who is in it, as an array of user names or DNs — a group can hold another group, and no user name names one. A form sends one string, split on newlines and commas. A bare name resolves to that person's OWN entry wherever it is, because somebody seeded by a client certificate is at `cn=<name>,ou=users` and a value written in the `uid=` form would dangle beside the entry it meant to name.",
    `$comb`:"oneOf"
