    `operationId`:"restoreIssuedArtifact",
    `summary`:"Stop disowning one assertion, ticket or SVID (NON-SPEC)",
    `description`:"The opposite of `revoke-artifact`, and NON-SPEC for the reason every restore here is. It is a smaller act than the others, because what it takes back never reached anybody: the credential was working throughout.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/tokens` on the admin console.",
