@endpoint("/admin-api/tokens/revoke-kind",
  "post",
  #{
    `operationId`:"revokeTokensByKind",
    `summary`:"Revoke every token of one kind",
    `description`:"Only the three JWT kinds can be revoked. Nothing consults this service about a SAML assertion or a Kerberos ticket — an assertion is valid because its signature verifies and its Conditions hold, a ticket because the service it names can decrypt it — so naming one of those is refused rather than silently doing nothing. `GET /admin-api/tokens` lists the three under `revocableKinds`.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/tokens` on the admin console.",
