    `description`:"The entry goes and takes its recorded sign-ins with it. **The PEOPLE it authenticated keep their entries under `ou=users`** — nothing is ever deleted from there — and any session they hold is unaffected until it expires or is ended, which is what `POST /admin-api/logout` is for.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/federation` on the admin console.",
