    `operationId`:"createAuthorizationServer",
    `summary`:"Add an authorization server profile",
    `description`:"The `id` is a single URL path segment, because it has to appear in a discovery URL without being escaped — one that had to be escaped would be one nobody could find again. A new profile has no overrides, so both its documents say exactly what this service says about itself, which is the right place to start from.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/authorization-servers` on the admin console.",
