    `description`:"The DIF Well-Known DID Configuration: one Domain Linkage Credential (JWT form), self-issued by the application's DID with credentialSubject `{ id, origin }`, signed with a key its DID document publishes whose private half this service kept (one `generate-did-key` made). Host `didConfiguration` at `https://<origin>/.well-known/did-configuration.json`. `origin` must be a `LinkedDomains` service in `didService`. Writes nothing. Refused (`STS-VC-0115`) for an application with no DID document, an origin it does not list, or no kept key.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/applications, POST /admin/applications/new, POST /admin/applications/edit and POST /admin/applications/owners` on the admin console.",
