    `description`:"Clears the flag on the incumbent first, because the store refuses a second root. Done in that order deliberately: a failure then leaves the repository with NO root rather than with two, which is the recoverable one of the two bad states.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-policies, POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-editor, POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-peps, POST /admin/xacml/policies, POST /admin/xacml/editor and POST /admin/xacml/peps` on the admin console.",
