@endpoint("/admin-api/xacml/delete",
  "post",
  #{
    `operationId`:"deleteXacmlPolicy",
    `summary`:"Remove a policy from the repository",
    `description`:"Deleting the ROOT leaves the repository deciding nothing, and the reply says so rather than letting it be discovered by a Deny.\n\nAN APPLICATION'S FINE-GRAINED POLICY (#564) is deleted only when no application names it in appFgaPolicy — an orphan of a deleted application (`applicationPolicies` on GET /admin-api/xacml/policies marks which). The one an application still names is refused (`STS-FGA-0022`); reset it with POST /admin-api/applications/fga-reset-policy instead.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-policies, POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-editor, POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-peps, POST /admin/xacml/policies, POST /admin/xacml/editor and POST /admin/xacml/peps` on the admin console.",
    `tags`:#["XACML"],
    `responses`:#{
      `200`:#{
        `description`:"The operation was applied.",
        `content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}
      },
      `400`:#{
        `description`:"The operation was refused; `errors` says why and nothing changed.",
        `content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}
      },
      `default`:#{
        `description`:"A refusal or a failure.",
        `content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}
      }
    },
    `requestBody`:#{`required`:true,`content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}},
    `security`:#[#{`oauth2`:#["admin:write"]},#{`bearerAuth`:#[]}]
  })
op `deleteXacmlPolicy`(@js(#{`examples`:#[#{`name`:"my-policy"}]}) `requestBody/content/application~1json/schema`: {
