    `description`:"Every element this editor adds arrives COMPLETE AND VALID — a new rule has a Target, an Effect and an id. An editor that produced half-built elements would hold a document that could not be saved, and a document that cannot be saved cannot be evaluated, which is when you most want to look at it.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-policies, POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-editor, POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-peps, POST /admin/xacml/policies, POST /admin/xacml/editor and POST /admin/xacml/peps` on the admin console.",
