  #{
    `operationId`:"addXacmlPolicySetToSet",
    `summary`:"Add a nested PolicySet inside a PolicySet",
    `description`:"There is no depth limit. It arrives with `deny-unless-permit` — the POLICY-combining spelling, which is a different URI from the rule-combining one of the same name.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-policies, POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-editor, POST /admin/xacml#xacml-tab-peps, POST /admin/xacml/policies, POST /admin/xacml/editor and POST /admin/xacml/peps` on the admin console.",
