    `description`:"A push stream whose pushes have all failed for `ssf.deadStreamTimeoutS` is declared DEAD: nothing more is pushed to it, its SETs go to its dead-letter queue, and a sweep pushes one as a probe every period. This revives it at once, so the next SET is pushed. Refused for a stream that is not dead. The dead letters are kept, and nothing resends them.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/ssf` on the admin console.",
