@endpoint("/admin-api/caep/clear",
  "post",
  #{
    `operationId`:"clearCaepSessions",
    `summary`:"Drop every row in the CAEP session register",
    `description`:"Forgets what has been said about every session. Nobody is signed out, no stream is touched and no queued event is dropped — those are the SSF half, at POST /admin-api/ssf/delete.\n\nIt is worth knowing what this throws away: rows for sessions this service NO LONGER HOLDS are the only evidence that those sessions existed and were revoked, and nothing else in this service records it.\n\n**Mirrors** `POST /admin/caep` on the admin console.",
